e real food  you said that you probably will never  try Botox I just don't think we know the  long-term effects of all all that stuff  never say never I never know I could be  40 going and I take back everything I  said now before the birth of Saylor  Kristen told us that she was kind of  scared about having three kids all under  the age of four yeah but like everything  in her life she's making it look easy  now
 

